{
    "_api": "这是企业微信应用 api 文件（支持 markdown / text / mpnews 三种消息类型）",
    "_api": "【企业微信应用】",
    "_note": "应用消息需先拿 corpid+corpsecret 换 access_token，再带 agentid 发送。token 由主脚本",
    "_note": "diy_send 预先取好放进 ${weapp_token}；图文消息的 ${weapp_thumb_media_id} 亦由脚本上传",
    "_note": "缩略图素材后填入，模板只负责留位，避免在 url 里内联 curl（失败时噪声大且难以复用）。",
    "_note": "type 内同时保留三种正文，diy_send 依 weapp_msgtype 用 jq 只保留对应一项；三种正文的",
    "_note": "排版标记互不通用（文本 \\n、图文 <br>/<hr>），故排版由脚本按消息类型覆盖模板默认值。",
    "_note": "应用 markdown 仅支持 info/comment/warning 三种颜色关键字，不支持自定义 hex，故 font_* 预设为空。",
    "url": "https://qyapi.weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/message/send?access_token=${weapp_token}",
    "data": "@${tempjsonpath}",
    "content_type": "Content-Type: application/json",
    "str_title_start": "#### ",
    "str_title_end": "",
    "str_linefeed": "\\n",
    "str_splitline": "\\n\\n",
    "str_space": " ",
    "str_tab": "> ",
    "table_tab": "",
    "font_success": "",
    "font_client": "",
    "font_fail": "",
    "font_module": "",
    "font_title": "",
    "font_end": "",
    "font_end2": "",
    "percentsym": "",
    "boldstar": "**",
    "type": {
        "touser": "\"${weapp_userid}\"",
        "msgtype": "\"markdown\"",
        "agentid": "\"${weapp_agentid}\"",
        "markdown": {
            "content": "\"${str_title_start}${1}${str_title_end}${str_linefeed}${nowtime}${str_linefeed}${2}\""
        },
        "text": {
            "content": "\"${1}${str_linefeed}${nowtime}${str_linefeed}${2}\""
        },
        "mpnews": {
            "articles": [
                {
                    "title": "\"${1} ${nowtime}\"",
                    "thumb_media_id": "\"${weapp_thumb_media_id}\"",
                    "author": "\"\"",
                    "content_source_url": "\"\"",
                    "content": "\"${2}\"",
                    "digest": "\"\""
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
